---
import ContentLink from '../components/ContentLink.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { cookieRecords, deviceRecords, COOKIE_CHOICE_DAYS } from '../lib/cookie-policy';
---

<Layout
  title="Cookie Policy"
  description="See which cookies and browser storage UltraClipart uses, why they are needed, how long they last and how to manage your choices."
>
  <article class="cookie-policy">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true"> / </span>
      <span aria-current="page">Cookie Policy</span>
    </nav>
    <header class="cookie-policy-hero">
      <div>
        <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
        <p>
          A clear look at the cookies that protect the site, the work saved on your device and the
          choices available to you.
        </p>
        <small>Last reviewed: October 25, 2026</small>
      </div>
      <div class="cookie-policy-hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="/illustrations/actions/cookies.svg" width="205" height="205" alt="" />
      </div>
    </header>
    <section id="cookie-preferences" aria-labelledby="cookie-choice-title">
      <h2 id="cookie-choice-title">Your Cookie Choices</h2>
      <p>
        UltraClipart currently uses necessary cookies for security, requested services and
        remembering this notice. Advertising and analytics cookies are not enabled. You can continue
        browsing with necessary cookies only.
      </p>
      <div class="cookie-policy-actions">
        <button type="button" data-cookie-choice="accepted">
          Accept Cookies
        </button>
        <button type="button" data-cookie-choice="necessary">
          Necessary Only
        </button>
        <a href="#cookie-preferences" data-cookie-settings>
          View Cookie Settings
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="cookie-policy-note">
        Both choices keep advertising and analytics disabled. Accepting covers the necessary cookies
        described here; it does not give permission for future tracking. We do not treat scrolling,
        closing a page or continuing to browse as consent.
      </p>
      <p data-cookie-choice-summary></p>
      <noscript>
        <p>
          Cookie settings need JavaScript. Only necessary cookies are used; you can also manage them
          through your browser’s site settings.
        </p>
      </noscript>
    </section>
    <section aria-labelledby="cookie-register-title">
      <h2 id="cookie-register-title">Cookies Used by This Site</h2>
      <p>
        A cookie is a small record your browser can send back to this site. These application
        cookies have the following specific purposes.
      </p>
      <div class="cookie-register">
        {cookieRecords.map((entry) => (
          <article>
            <h3>{entry.name}</h3>
            <p class="cookie-provider">{entry.provider}</p>
            <p>{entry.purpose}</p>
            <dl>
              <dt>Duration</dt>
              <dd>{entry.duration}</dd>
              <dt>When it is used</dt>
              <dd>{entry.when}</dd>
            </dl>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="device-storage" aria-labelledby="cookie-device-title">
      <h2 id="cookie-device-title">Work Saved on Your Device</h2>
      <p>
        Browser storage is different from a cookie, but it also matters for privacy. The features
        below keep information locally when you use them. They do not send your boards, project
        files or local history to an advertising or analytics service.
      </p>
      <div class="cookie-register cookie-device-register">
        {deviceRecords.map((entry) => (
          <article>
            <h3>{entry.name}</h3>
            <p class="cookie-provider">{entry.technology} · This browser</p>
            <p>{entry.purpose}</p>
            <dl>
              <dt>Duration</dt>
              <dd>{entry.duration}</dd>
            </dl>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p class="cookie-policy-note">
        Choosing Necessary Only does not delete Favorites, boards or projects. Clearing all site
        data in your browser can remove that work and public-link removal keys. Download project
        files and export a Favorites backup before clearing data you want to keep.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section aria-labelledby="cookie-security-title">
      <h2 id="cookie-security-title">Hosting and Security Checks</h2>
      <p>
        Cloudflare delivers and protects this website. The Builder and public-link tools use
        Turnstile security checks. Cloudflare may apply security mechanisms according to the hosting
        and challenge configuration; any such security cookies are separate from advertising or
        analytics.
      </p>
      <p>
        Loading the site and these services sends ordinary connection information to the hosting
        provider. Our region check uses only Cloudflare’s approximate country result to decide
        whether to show the notice. It does not request your device’s location, return your IP
        address to the page or store a country profile.
      </p>
      <p>
        For details about request processing and the services you choose, read our{' '}
        <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> and{' '}
        <ContentLink href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">
          Cloudflare’s Privacy Policy
        </ContentLink>
        .
      </p>
    </section>
    <section aria-labelledby="cookie-region-title">
      <h2 id="cookie-region-title">Where and How Long the Notice Appears</h2>
      <p>
        The initial strip is shown outside the United States. If the country cannot be established,
        including in a local preview, the strip is shown as well. VPNs and network routing can
        affect this approximate result. Cookie Settings and this policy remain available to
        everyone.
      </p>
      <p>
        We remember either choice for {COOKIE_CHOICE_DAYS} days on this browser. The notice appears
        again when the record expires, is cleared or no longer matches the current policy version.
        If your browser blocks this record, the notice may reappear on later pages. A saved choice
        never authorizes an unrelated new purpose.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section aria-labelledby="cookie-control-title">
      <h2 id="cookie-control-title">Review or Change Your Choice</h2>
      <p>
        Choose Cookie Policy in the footer, then open Cookie Settings to review the current setup or
        choose Necessary Only. You can also remove cookies through your browser’s site settings.
        Blocking essential security cookies can prevent protected Builder or public-link requests
        from working.
      </p>
      <p>
        There are no optional tracking services to activate in the current settings. If a new
        purpose requiring consent is introduced, it will need a specific choice before it is
        enabled.
      </p>
      <div class="cookie-policy-actions">
        <a href="#cookie-preferences" data-cookie-settings>
          Open Cookie Settings
        </a>
        <a href="/privacy/">Read the Privacy Policy</a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section aria-labelledby="cookie-reference-title">
      <h2 id="cookie-reference-title">Guidance Behind This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        Our current approach distinguishes necessary services from optional tracking, explains
        device storage and keeps the choices easy to reach. Relevant guidance includes the{' '}
        <ContentLink href="https://ico.org.uk/for-organisations/direct-marketing-and-privacy-and-electronic-communications/guidance-on-the-use-of-storage-and-access-technologies/">
          ICO’s storage and access guidance, finalized April 29, 2026
        </ContentLink>
        ,{' '}
        <ContentLink href="https://cnil.fr/fr/cookies-et-autres-traceurs/que-dit-la-loi">
          CNIL’s cookie guidance
        </ContentLink>{' '}
        and the{' '}
        <ContentLink href="https://www.kvkk.gov.tr/SharedFolderServer/CMSFiles/fb193dbb-b159-4221-8a7b-3addc083d33f.pdf">
          Turkish authority’s cookie guidance, July 2025
        </ContentLink>
        .
      </p>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy or your information:{' '}
        <a href="mailto:ultraclipart@gmail.com">ultraclipart@gmail.com</a>. UltraClipart is the
        operator of this site.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
